{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach, take and process visible, grabbable and checked object, then move to the next location. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    />\"",
